  "weixin_html": "<section data-side-margin=\"0\" style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;background-color:#ffffff;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI','PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#1f2937;overflow:hidden;\"><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/xm1dT1jCe8lIO3P2oFVtd1x040PKGCRPN033gUTrHQQz0Licdqug5X1QgUPQBRCicoTqdYMrpgk7etibXLkK9rwcg/0?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\" alt=\"关注提示\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:24px 0 8px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff8f1 0%,#ffffff 100%);\"><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0 16px 20px;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:#f97316;letter-spacing:0.08em;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;\">Daily Model Hub</p><h1 style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.4;color:#111827;font-weight:800;\">每日精选HuggingFace热门模型</h1><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#6b7280;\">2026-09-14 · Hugging Face 热门模型速览</p></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#1 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-09-14/01-deepseek-ai-deepseek-v4-1-flash.png\" alt=\"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash 是深度求索推出的一款高性能语言模型，核心技术亮点在于对 KV Cache 进行了深度压缩。通过显著降低推理过程中的显存占用与计算开销，该模型旨在提升长文本处理效率，特别适用于对实时性与算力资源敏感的各种大规模应用场景。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#2 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-09-14/02-openbmb-minicpm5-2b.png\" alt=\"openbmb/MiniCPM5-2B\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">openbmb/MiniCPM5-2B</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">MiniCPM5-2B 是 OpenBMB 开发的高效能轻量级模型。该模型以 20 亿参数的体量实现了极高的性能表现，旨在平衡端侧部署的灵活性与复杂任务的处理能力。它非常适合在移动设备、嵌入式系统或资源受限的边缘计算环境中运行，满足基本的自然语言处理需求。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#3 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-09-14/03-edge0-edge0-35b-a3b-preview.png\" alt=\"Edge0/Edge0-35B-A3B-preview\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">Edge0/Edge0-35B-A3B-preview</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Edge0-35B-A3B-preview 是一款拥有 350 亿参数的混合专家（MoE）模型。得益于 Edge0 流式推理框架，该模型在低于 3 GiB 的活动内存占用下即可实现流畅推理。这一特性显著降低了大模型部署的硬件准入门槛，适合在内存受限的设备上实现高性能推理。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#4 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-09-14/04-nex-agi-nex-n2-5-mini.png\" alt=\"nex-agi/Nex-N2.5-mini\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">nex-agi/Nex-N2.5-mini</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Nex-N2.5-mini 是由 Nex-AGI 开发的轻量化通用大语言模型。作为 mini 系列版本，该模型重点优化了参数效率与推理速度，旨在通过精简架构在保持合理智能水平的同时，提供快速的响应能力，特别适合各类需要高频交互及轻量化集成的应用场景。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#5 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-09-14/05-qwen-qwen3-8-27b.png\" alt=\"Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Qwen3.8-27B 是通义千问系列的大规模语言模型，具备 270 亿参数规模。该模型在经过广泛的后训练后，展现出较强的通用处理能力与指令遵循效果，能够兼容 Hugging Face、vLLM 及 SGLang 等主流框架，适用于构建各类高性能、高并发的生产级智能服务。</p></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/qHfXxy1pes1eXWicJWxHTLGxL323Gh029A2JkOLQP3EibEUYlkLeB2vgvuhnUoyqoPg1etjxySFodeO